  "title": "nl80211: Dissect NL80211_ATTR_PROTOCOL_FEATURES values",
  "description": "\nBefore:\n```\nFrame 3: Packet, 44 bytes on wire (352 bits), 44 bytes captured (352 bits) on interface nlmon0, id 0\nLinux netlink (cooked header)\nLinux Generic Netlink protocol\nLinux 802.11 Netlink\n    Attribute: NL80211_ATTR_PROTOCOL_FEATURES\n        Len: 8\n        Type: 0x00ad, NL80211_ATTR_PROTOCOL_FEATURES (173)\n        Attribute Value: 0x00000001 (1)\n```\n\nAfter:\n```\nFrame 3: Packet, 44 bytes on wire (352 bits), 44 bytes captured (352 bits) on interface nlmon0, id 0\nLinux netlink (cooked header)\nLinux Generic Netlink protocol\nLinux 802.11 Netlink\n    Attribute: NL80211_ATTR_PROTOCOL_FEATURES\n        Len: 8\n        Type: 0x00ad, NL80211_ATTR_PROTOCOL_FEATURES (173)\n        Attribute Value: NL80211_PROTOCOL_FEATURE_SPLIT_WIPHY_DUMP (1)\n```\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
